      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<blockquote>\n<p>‘‘We do not deal with cat-tongued, honorless dogs! Take these so-called Sigmarites away.’</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:right\">– Denfather Klaus Liebnitz, Deputy High Priest of Ulric</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div style=\"font-style:normal\">\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<h3 style=\"font-style:normal\">Often called \"man's best friend\" dogs are a fitting companion for an adventurer.</h3>\n<p>Dogs have a long association with the folk of the Old World. They perform all manner of tasks, including hunting, herding, entertainment, pulling loads, guarding, going to war, companionship, and more besides. They are so intertwined with Old World society that its no surprise many believe dogs were domesticated as Taal's last gift to mortals before renouncing the mortal plane after the First Great War Against Chaos.</p>\n<p style=\"font-style:normal\"> </p>\n<p><strong>Species: </strong>Dog</p>\n<p><strong>Class: </strong>Henchman (Pet)</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">Dog Advance Scheme</h3>\n<table style=\"height:34px\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height:17px\">\n<td style=\"height:17px;width:60px;text-align:center\">WS</td>\n<td style=\"height:17px;width:60px;text-align:center\">BS</td>\n<td style=\"height:17px;width:60px;text-align:center\">S</td>\n<td style=\"height:17px;width:61px;text-align:center\">T</td>\n<td style=\"height:17px;width:61px;text-align:center\">I</td>\n<td style=\"height:17px;width:61px;text-align:center\">Agi</td>\n<td style=\"height:17px;width:61px;text-align:center\">Dex</td>\n<td style=\"height:17px;width:61px;text-align:center\">Int</td>\n<td style=\"height:17px;width:61px;text-align:center\">WP</td>\n<td style=\"height:17px;width:61px;text-align:center\">Fel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height:17px\">\n<td style=\"height:17px;width:60px;text-align:center\">I</td>\n<td style=\"height:17px;width:60px;text-align:center\"> </td>\n<td style=\"height:17px;width:60px;text-align:center\">II</td>\n<td style=\"height:17px;width:61px;text-align:center\">III</td>\n<td style=\"height:17px;width:61px;text-align:center\">I</td>\n<td style=\"height:17px;width:61px;text-align:center\">IV</td>\n<td style=\"height:17px;width:61px;text-align:center\"> </td>\n<td style=\"height:17px;width:61px;text-align:center\"> </td>\n<td style=\"height:17px;width:61px;text-align:center\">I</td>\n<td style=\"height:17px;width:61px;text-align:center\"> </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3><strong>I. <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-laws-pet-shoppe.pet_careers\" data-id=\"hDQoK75razUTFgoI\"> Trainee Dog</a></strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Status</strong>: –<br /><strong>Skills</strong>: <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-core.skills\" data-id=\"LGHozP5gmQ8cuDQV\"> Athletics</a><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-47467c86-7fff-77e7-257c-5bafd6910be0\">, <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-core.skills\" data-id=\"exLrBrn2mjb6x2Cq\"> Charm</a></span>, <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-core.skills\" data-id=\"1jCxbFAUuFuAPLJl\"> Dodge</a>, <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-core.skills\" data-id=\"I0yPc4PH5erWJLmu\"> Intimidate</a>, <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-core.skills\" data-id=\"Fs06sr7y9JKpVQmB\"> Perception</a>, <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-core.skills\" data-id=\"HO8vIjGTHjmenIaV\"> Perform (Obedience)</a>, <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-core.skills\" data-id=\"hodHqFNKAmu40ajh\"> Swim</a>, <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-core.skills\" data-id=\"rt2rGSwFDCDHPh0A\"> Track</a><br /><strong>Talents</strong>: <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-core.talents\" data-id=\"9h82z72XGo9tfgQS\"> Acute Sense (Smell)</a>, <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-core.talents\" data-id=\"5KP9sOoLSGvj9EXp\"> Beneath Notice</a>, <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-core.talents\" data-id=\"jrFIFLhyOYwcyMUl\"> Flee!</a>, <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-core.talents\" data-id=\"x0WMGwuQzReXcQrs\"> Night Vision</a><br /><strong>Trappings</strong>: –<br /><br /></p>\n<h3><strong>II. <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-laws-pet-shoppe.pet_careers\" data-id=\"H15dUmnaq8QqUUZf\"> Dog</a></strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Status</strong>: –<br /><strong>Skills</strong>: <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-core.skills\" data-id=\"pxNjTxsp1Kp0SmQe\"> Cool</a>, <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-core.skills\" data-id=\"cYtU0ORRFCOpQLWz\"> Intuition</a>, <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-core.skills\" data-id=\"F8NfBZdVSEIGCMtu\"> Melee (Tooth &amp; Claw)</a>, <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-core.skills\" data-id=\"zZUX7wO4rOo8k9F0\"> Navigation</a>, <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-core.skills\" data-id=\"os4NKy5Oy6sRt1eh\"> Outdoor Survival</a>, <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-core.skills\" data-id=\"HO8vIjGTHjmenIaV\"> Perform (Tricks)</a><br /><strong>Talents</strong>: <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-core.talents\" data-id=\"tXKX29QZBdHmyMc7\"> Combat Reflexes</a>, <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-core.talents\" data-id=\"6w30u0VPsAicrqb5\"> Magical Sense</a>, <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-core.talents\" data-id=\"0hn6UaKq8CoZP2zD\"> Menacing</a>, <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-core.talents\" data-id=\"CV9btQn09S9Fn8Jk\"> Strong Legs</a><br /><strong>Trappings</strong>: –<br /><br /></p>\n<h3><strong>III. <a class=\"entity-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"wfrp4e-laws-pet-shoppe.pet_careers\" data-id=\"nrgweZaFQyOYnSc